# TASK/ACCTITLE regression, EmuDESK (in-kernel desktop, no #Z; the card's
# C:\ACC\SYSACC.NAC + C:\SYSACC2.NAC registered): hover "Desk" (26,9) ->
# drop-down with the two accessory entries; click the first accessory entry
# (60,66) -> AC_OPEN -> SYSACC's form_alert; Return closes it.
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py). IKBD Return 1C.
100 parkbr
400 mark D00_IDLE
500 move 26 9
900 mark D01_DESK_OPEN
1000 move 60 66
1200 down
1203 up
2200 mark D02_ACC_OPENED
2400 key 1C
2406 key 9C
3000 mark D03_ALERT_CLOSED
3100 parkbr
3400 mark END
